      "title": "英語を直接使うサンプル",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "①を空欄にし、次の本文を③へコピーしてください。`Duration: 15 seconds`を変えると尺が変わります。LM Studioは不要です。\n\n```text\nDuration: 15 seconds\n\nintegrated_multimodal_description: Soft anime style. [Shot 1] One adult traveler stands on a quiet park path, waves once slowly at the camera, then rests their hand and smiles. A gentle breeze moves their hair and jacket. A single continuous shot with a fixed camera. No speech or on-screen text.\n\noverall_soundscape: Soft wind, rustling leaves and distant birds.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: N/A\n```"
      ],
      "color": "#243645",
      "bgcolor": "#17232d"
    },
    {
      "id": 509,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        3030,
